    'all_common.r'
    'classes.r'
    'generics.r'
    'tv-methods.r'
    'garch-methods.r'
    'specTest-methods.r'
    'tvgarch-methods.r'
    'dataGenProcess.r'
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
